        "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:jnzaardlvkrjurtvgig4fhj7/bafkreia4w34qfozpuuyrduy47rw2tdsfwwz3xux3jh7yotsfuxvrpqlzim",
        "text": "San Antonio Spurs forward-center Victor Wembanyama and Miami Heat forward Giannis Antetokounmpo have been named the NBA Western and Eastern Conference Players of the Week, respectively, for Week 4 of the 2026-27 season (Nov. 9-15).",
